# JA-EduSIS (`ja-edusis`)

This repository is **JA-EduSIS** (*Jejakawan Educational School Information System*), an enterprise-grade integrated school information system, academic management engine, and educational community portal.

## Canonical facts
- **Branch:** `main` (Remote: `git@github.com:jejak-awan/edusis.git`).
- **Architecture:** Modular Monolith with 14 Backend Laravel Modules and 13 Frontend Vue 3 Modules.
- **Core Domain (`Modules/School`):** Institutional hierarchy (Dapodik compliant), Academic (Kurikulum Merdeka), Student affairs & discipline points, HR/GTK, Administration/Secretariat, Facilities/Assets, PPDB, OSIS E-Voting, and WhatsApp Gateway.
- **Portal & Community:** Public portal on **Sarangenge** baseline theme (`Modules/Layout`), Publishing (news/articles), and Member Portal for students/parents (`Modules/Member`).
- **Platform Kernel:** `Modules/Core` (System, IAM/RBAC, Infra, Security).
- **CBT Separation:** EduSIS **DOES NOT** run an interactive CBT exam runner or question authoring engine here; exam delivery is delegated to **JA-Katampi** (Aksara cluster) via API & Webhook synchronization.
- **Infrastructure:** PostgreSQL 16+/18 with isolated schema **`edusis`** · Valkey CT 206 (`10.20.0.206:6379`) · MinIO CDN (`ja-cdn`).

