## Do / don't
- **Call this product JA-EduSIS** (not `ja-core_engine`, not `ja-cms`).
- **Use `sch_*` prefix** for all School module database tables inside schema `edusis`.
- **Do not build a CBT exam runner** in this codebase — keep exam delivery delegated to KataMPI.
- **Protect PII data** (NISN, NIK, student & parent contact numbers) with appropriate masking and authorization.
- **Quality Gates:** Maintain PHPStan Level 9 strict typing with zero baseline tolerance; run `npm run agent:verify` and Pest test suites before marking work done.
- **Commit convention:** Always use `feat(...)` conventional commits (e.g. `feat(school): ...`, `feat(system): ...`).
- **Never commit secrets / `.env`**.
- Keep per-module `README.md` + `CHANGELOG.md` updated (see `.cursor/rules/module-documentation.mdc`).
